0,Zauzou language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zauzou_language,"Zauzou (Rouruo 柔若, Jaojo, Raorou; autonym: zau55 zou33) is a Loloish language of Tu'e District (兔峨地区), Lanping County, Yunnan, China. It is most closely related to Nusu.",Zauzou,Sino-Tibetan
